    x2    E2       EV         Secondary energy: particle energy    ///electron-Volts
/Summary of Reaction-Codes
Summary of Units 2
---basicUnits:PC/FIS/MEV  category:FYDE
   FYDE 1/3   PC/FIS/MEV  1e-08           particl. per 100 fissions per MeV
